{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the near future and this world has taken a turn for the worse. How on Earth will we find our way back? Is it even possible?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win robot battles to decide your share prices and the fate of your community in this unique FPS experience</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle in Unique Locations Across the World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle commences in 14 totally different remote locations across the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shape of the battlefield changes the pace of the fight</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Understand the world of Androfoco</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play story mode to fight in robot battles and watch how your town improves for the community</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak to other people in your town to learn how the world came to be like this</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your robot's attacks, shields and manuevers to suit your playing style then test your skills against other players in the online battle mode</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3771980?t=1770477163","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3771980?t=1770477163","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771980/b8f84f1bb9344deef13ed122358464cbdb48b2d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770477163","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771980/b8f84f1bb9344deef13ed122358464cbdb48b2d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770477163","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"des